From: Waltteri Hooli <1420194+wahooli@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: aw88261: retry the start at prepare

The amp starts at DAPM PRE_PMU of its playback AIF and checks its PLL
against the I2S clocks there, retrying five times in quick succession.
After system sleep ASoC powers DAPM back up before userspace prepares
the suspended stream again, so with a DSP back end that stops its port
for sleep the clocks are not running yet, the start fails and nothing
tries again: the AYANEO Pocket VERT's speakers stayed silent after
resume ("start failure (-1)").

Remember that DAPM has the playback path up, and retry the start from
the DAI's prepare, which runs after the CPU DAI's and so with the port
running. With the amp already started it returns at once. While the card
is still resuming (not back at D0), skip the doomed attempt and leave the
start to prepare.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.h
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.h
@@ -592,6 +592,7 @@
 	int frcset_en;
 	unsigned int mute_st;
 	unsigned int amppd_st;
+	bool playback_pmu;
 
 	unsigned int sr_value;
 	unsigned int cco_mux_value;
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
@@ -865,7 +865,24 @@
 	return 0;
 }
 
+/*
+ * After system sleep DAPM powers the amp up before the stream is prepared
+ * again, so with the I2S port still stopped the PLL check fails. The CPU DAI
+ * is prepared first and starts the port: try again now.
+ */
+static int aw88261_dai_prepare(struct snd_pcm_substream *substream, struct snd_soc_dai *dai)
+{
+	struct aw88261 *aw88261 = snd_soc_component_get_drvdata(dai->component);
+
+	guard(mutex)(&aw88261->lock);
+	if (aw88261->playback_pmu)
+		aw88261_start(aw88261);
+
+	return 0;
+}
+
 static const struct snd_soc_dai_ops aw88261_dai_ops = {
+	.prepare = aw88261_dai_prepare,
 	.set_fmt = aw88261_set_fmt,
 	.hw_params = aw88261_hw_params,
 	.set_tdm_slot = aw88261_set_tdm_slot,
@@ -1039,9 +1056,13 @@
 	guard(mutex)(&aw88261->lock);
 	switch (event) {
 	case SND_SOC_DAPM_PRE_PMU:
-		aw88261_start(aw88261);
+		aw88261->playback_pmu = true;
+		/* Still resuming: the port is stopped, so prepare starts the amp. */
+		if (snd_power_get_state(component->card->snd_card) == SNDRV_CTL_POWER_D0)
+			aw88261_start(aw88261);
 		break;
 	case SND_SOC_DAPM_POST_PMD:
+		aw88261->playback_pmu = false;
 		aw88261_dev_stop(aw88261->aw_pa);
 		break;
 	default:
